<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Papa's Pitufos | Início</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        royalDark: { 950: '#030712', 900: '#0B132B', 800: '#1C2541', 700: '#2A365B' },
                        champagne: { 100: '#FAF8F5', 200: '#F3EDE2', 300: '#E7DC8A', 400: '#D2C1A0' },
                        goldAccent: { 300: '#F7E7A9', 400: '#E5C158', 500: '#D4AF37', 600: '#B89228' },
                        sapphire: { 300: '#93C5FD', 400: '#60A5FA', 500: '#2563EB', 600: '#1D4ED8', 800: '#1E3A8A', 900: '#0F172A' }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Plus Jakarta Sans', 'sans-serif'],
                        serif: ['Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', 'serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background-color: #030712; color: #F3EDE2; overflow-x: hidden; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #030712; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2563EB; border-radius: 9999px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #D4AF37; }
        .glass-panel { background: rgba(11, 19, 43, 0.88); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25); }
        .glass-card { background: rgba(28, 37, 65, 0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15); transition: all 0.4s; }
        .glass-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.45); }
        .gold-glow { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); }
        .sapphire-glow { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between bg-royalDark-950">

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 glass-panel border-b border-sapphire-500/30 px-4 lg:px-12 py-4">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="index.html" class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-goldAccent-500/40 flex items-center justify-center bg-royalDark-900 shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-goldAccent-400 text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase">Papa's Pitufos</h1>
                    <p class="text-[9px] text-sapphire-400 tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold">Oitava Nota Gastrobar</p>
                </div>
            </a>

            <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 bg-royalDark-950/90 p-1.5 rounded-full border border-sapphire-500/30 text-xs font-medium">
                <a href="index.html" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-goldAccent-400 bg-sapphire-600/30 border border-goldAccent-500/40 font-bold">Início</a>
                <a href="cardapio.html" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-all">Cardápio</a>
                <a href="alquimia.html" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-all">A Alquimia</a>
                <a href="experiencias.html" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-all">Experiências</a>
                <a href="reservas.html" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-all">Reservas VIP</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
                <button onclick="toggleCartModal()" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-sapphire-600 via-sapphire-700 to-sapphire-800 border border-goldAccent-500/30 text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2 text-xs">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wine-glass text-goldAccent-400"></i>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">Pedido</span>
                    <span id="cart-badge-count" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-royalDark-950 text-goldAccent-400 text-[10px] font-black border border-goldAccent-500/40">0</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="relative z-10 flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-24">
        <section class="relative min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center py-8">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center w-full">
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-sapphire-500/10 border border-sapphire-400/30 text-sapphire-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-gem text-[10px] text-goldAccent-400"></i> Alta Gastronomia & Mixologia Pitufo
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-serif font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]">Onde a Alquimia Encanta os Sentidos.</h1>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-light">Uma experiência gastronômica memorável. Ingredientes raros de origem certificada, preparos moleculares e coquetelaria exclusiva em um ambiente azul safira intimista e refinado.</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-4">
                        <a href="cardapio.html" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-sapphire-600 hover:bg-sapphire-500 border border-goldAccent-500/40 text-white font-bold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils text-goldAccent-400"></i> Explorar Cardápio Gourmet
                        </a>
                        <a href="reservas.html" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full glass-card text-champagne-100 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase hover:bg-royalDark-800 transition-all border border-sapphire-500/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-sapphire-400"></i> Reserva VIP
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
                    <div class="relative glass-card rounded-3xl p-4 border border-sapphire-500/40 max-w-md w-full shadow-2xl sapphire-glow">
                        <div class="relative h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Tornedor Wagyu" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-royalDark-950/95 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-left">
                                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-goldAccent-400">Criação Assinada</span>
                                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white">Tornedor Wagyu A5 ao Poivre Nobre</h3>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-center space-y-6 border border-sapphire-500/30 gold-glow">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-goldAccent-400">Crítica Gastronômica Internacional</span>
            <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-2xl text-champagne-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto italic leading-relaxed">"O Papa's Pitufos redefine a haute cuisine contemporânea com uma atmosfera azul safira inigualável, insumos raríssimos e harmonizações geniais."</blockquote>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-sapphire-400 uppercase tracking-wider">— Guia Internacional de Gastronomia Fina</p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="glass-panel border-t border-sapphire-500/30 py-8 text-center text-xs text-gray-400">
        <p>© 2026 Papa's Pitufos Haute Cuisine. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
